 <h3><u>Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa</font></font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Asman dekh raha tha, sakka koyi faraat pe aye tha tashnalab, mashkiza bhar ke jaanibe khayma chala wo jab, barse wo teer chidgayi mashk-e-sakina jab, roya alam faraat wafa mashk aur sab. Gunji maktal mei shah-e-deen ki sada</font></p>
  <font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> <p>(Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa) x2 Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi, Aya maktal se alam khun me bhara </p> <p>(Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2 Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa (Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>(Din dhala sham-e-ghariban ke andhere chaaye) x2 bas Sakina ne yahi roke kaha</li>
    <p>(Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2 Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa (Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2</p>
    <li>(Ab mere sar se ridaa jayengi zainab ne kaha) x2 Rodiye sar ke shah-e-karbobala</li>
    <p>(Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2 Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa (Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2</p>
    <li>(Tere ammu to teri pyaas pe kurbaan huwe) x2 sheh ne ye bali sakina se kaha</li>
    <p>(Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2 Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa (Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2</p>
    <li>(Haath mei sukhe huwe kuze liye bethe the) x2 Marsiya pyaas ka maula se suna</li>
    <p>(Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2 Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa (Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2</p>
    <li>(Khun-e-abbas jo parcham se tapakte dekha) x2 Dukhtar-e-shah ka dil dub gaya</li>
    <p>(Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2 Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa (Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2</p>
    <li>(Roke kulsum se fizza ne kaha shehzadi) x2 Teri chadar ka muhafiz bhi gaya</li>
    <li>(Dono haatho se kamar thame huwe sheh ne kaha) x2 bujh gaya meri ummido ka diyya</li>
    <p>(Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2 Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa (Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2</p>
    <li>(Alatash kehke jo rote the wo khamosh huwe) x2 Jaaye mahaar be matam ki fazaa</li>
    <p>(Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2 Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa (Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2</p>
    <li>(Roye sadat to daryaa ka kanara roya) x2 Zindagi royi kahi(n) royi kazaa</li>
   </ol> <p>(Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2 Qatl darya pe alamdar huwa (Aur pyaaso ki ye aas tut gayi) x2</p></font>
